    {
      "id": "noteFlips",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -60,
      "y": 135,
      "init": {
        "label": "Flip points",
        "body": "### How close is the call?\n**Flip points** reads the same Weights table. For each criterion it shows the weight at which another laptop would win if that criterion mattered less, or more. Where nothing would change, it names the laptop that stays on top. A flip near the weight means the pick hangs on it.",
        "color": "blue",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 200
      }
    }
  ],
